    "description": "Iran-focused digital newsletters range from individual editorial selections to expert essays and newsroom email services. Their subscription pages reveal different approaches to selecting and explaining material, but do not establish audience size or influence.",
    "tags": ["Digital newsletters", "Iran coverage", "Email publishing", "Media literacy", "Editorial curation"],
    "status": null,
    "editorial_status": "needs_research",
